@startuml End to End Overview

title End to end: from a donation to a closed convoy
caption Target design. Each stage links to its own process diagram in docs/process.

|Donor|
start
:Email HQ that goods are coming;
note right: optional (O22)

|Loader|
:Receive and check in the box at a hub\n(02 Donation and box intake);
:Record items: category, value, expiry;
:Attest the box and print its bilingual label;

|Dispatcher|
:Plan the convoy: route points, truck list,\nbudget, equipment, crew, leader,\ninsurance, ferry, accommodation\n(04 Convoy planning);
:Allocate attested boxes to vehicles;

|Administrator|
:Sign off each vehicle's load\n(05 Load sign-off and declarations);

|Dispatcher|
:File or record each vehicle's declarations\n(GMR, ENS, ELO, Ukrainian goods list);

if (Load changes after filing?) then (yes)
  :Re-approval and re-declaration\n(06 Load change and re-declare);
else (no)
endif

:Depart the convoy\n(07 Departure);
note right: refused until every blocking requirement holds

|Convoy Leader|
:Lead the convoy, mark progress and crossings,\nenter fuel, record border refusals\n(08 On the road);
:Mark vehicles and boxes delivered;
:Record acceptance per goods list\n(09 Delivery, acceptance and closing);

|Dispatcher|
:Mark the convoy arrived;
:Close the convoy and read the report;
stop

@enduml
